          "filename": "05_1_kkt_duality_slsqp_ridge.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(11)\nn, d = 300, 4\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, d))\nw_true = np.array([2.5, -1.8, 1.4, -0.9])\ny = X @ w_true + rng.normal(0.0, 0.5, size=n)\n\n# Masalah Primal Berbatas Bola L2:\n# min_w (1/(2n)) ||Xw - y||_2^2  s.t.  g(w) = 0.5*(||w||_2^2 - R^2) <= 0\nR = 2.0\n\ndef primal_obj(w):\n    r = X @ w - y\n    return float(0.5 * np.mean(r ** 2))\n\ndef primal_grad(w):\n    return (X.T @ (X @ w - y)) / n\n\n# Bandingkan solusi tanpa kendala (OLS) vs berbatas bola R=2.0\nw_ols = np.linalg.lstsq(X, y, rcond=None)[0]\nprint(f\"Norm L2 solusi OLS tanpa batas : {np.linalg.norm(w_ols):.4f} (Batas R={R:.1f})\")\n\ncons = {\n    \"type\": \"ineq\",\n    \"fun\": lambda w: 0.5 * (R ** 2 - np.dot(w, w)),  # >= 0 setara g(w) <= 0\n    \"jac\": lambda w: -w,\n}\nres = minimize(primal_obj, np.zeros(d), jac=primal_grad, method=\"SLSQP\", constraints=[cons], tol=1e-10)\nw_star = res.x\n\n# Pulihkan pengali Lagrange optimal lambda* dari syarat stasioneritas: grad_f(w*) + lambda* w* = 0\ng_star = primal_grad(w_star)\nlam_star = float(-np.dot(g_star, w_star) / np.dot(w_star, w_star))\ng_ineq = float(0.5 * (np.dot(w_star, w_star) - R ** 2))\nstationarity_res = float(np.linalg.norm(g_star + lam_star * w_star))\ncomp_slack = abs(lam_star * g_ineq)\n\n# Verifikasi kesetaraan eksak dengan Scikit-Learn Ridge(alpha = n * lam_star)\nridge = Ridge(alpha=n * lam_star, fit_intercept=False).fit(X, y)\nw_ridge = ridge.coef_\n\n# Evaluasi Dual Objective: q(lambda) = min_w [ f(w) + lambda * 0.5*(||w||^2 - R^2) ]\ndual_val = primal_obj(w_ridge) + lam_star * 0.5 * (np.dot(w_ridge, w_ridge) - R ** 2)\nduality_gap = primal_obj(w_star) - dual_val\n\nprint(\"--- Audit 4 Syarat KKT & Strong Duality (Slater) ---\")\nprint(f\"1. Primal Feasibility  g(w*) <= 0         : {g_ineq:+.3e}\")\nprint(f\"2. Dual Feasibility    lambda* >= 0       : {lam_star:.6f}\")\nprint(f\"3. Complementary Slack |lambda* g(w*)|    : {comp_slack:.3e}\")\nprint(f\"4. Stationarity        ||grad L(w*)||_2   : {stationarity_res:.3e}\")\nprint(f\"Selisih bobot SLSQP vs Ridge(alpha=n*lam) : {np.linalg.norm(w_star - w_ridge):.3e}\")\nprint(f\"Primal Obj = {primal_obj(w_star):.6f} | Dual Obj = {dual_val:.6f} | Duality Gap = {duality_gap:.3e}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "Norm L2 solusi OLS tanpa batas : 3.4884 (Batas R=2.0)\n--- Audit 4 Syarat KKT & Strong Duality (Slater) ---\n1. Primal Feasibility  g(w*) <= 0         : +4.601e-13\n2. Dual Feasibility    lambda* >= 0       : 0.726607\n3. Complementary Slack |lambda* g(w*)|    : 3.343e-13\n4. Stationarity        ||grad L(w*)||_2   : 1.830e-07\nSelisih bobot SLSQP vs Ridge(alpha=n*lam) : 1.020e-07\nPrimal Obj = 1.205670 | Dual Obj = 1.205670 | Duality Gap = -3.249e-13",
          "actualOutput": "Norm L2 solusi OLS tanpa batas : 3.4884 (Batas R=2.0)\n--- Audit 4 Syarat KKT & Strong Duality (Slater) ---\n1. Primal Feasibility  g(w*) <= 0         : +4.601e-13\n2. Dual Feasibility    lambda* >= 0       : 0.726607\n3. Complementary Slack |lambda* g(w*)|    : 3.343e-13\n4. Stationarity        ||grad L(w*)||_2   : 1.830e-07\nSelisih bobot SLSQP vs Ridge(alpha=n*lam) : 1.020e-07\nPrimal Obj = 1.205670 | Dual Obj = 1.205670 | Duality Gap = -3.249e-13",
