          "filename": "05_3_effective_decay_warmup_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\n# Audit 1: Rasio Effective Weight Decay pada Adam+L2 vs AdamW lintas skala gradien\nlam = 0.1\neps = 1e-8\nrms_grads = np.array([0.05, 0.5, 5.0, 50.0])\n\nprint(\"=== Audit Effective Weight Decay per Parameter (lambda nominal = 0.10) ===\")\nprint(f\"{'sqrt(v_hat)':>12} | {'Adam+L2 lambda_eff':>20} | {'AdamW lambda_eff':>18} | {'Distorsi':>10}\")\nfor r in rms_grads:\n    eff_adam_l2 = lam / (r + eps)\n    eff_adamw = lam\n    print(f\"{r:12.2f} | {eff_adam_l2:20.5f} | {eff_adamw:18.5f} | {eff_adam_l2 / eff_adamw:9.2f}x\")\n\n# Audit 2: Mengapa Warmup menstabilkan loncatan langkah (step norm) di awal pelatihan\nrng = np.random.default_rng(99)\nd = 64\nsteps = 60\nbeta1, beta2 = 0.9, 0.999\nbase_lr = 0.01\n\ndef measure_step_norms(use_warmup: bool):\n    m = np.zeros(d)\n    v = np.zeros(d)\n    norms = []\n    for t in range(1, steps + 1):\n        # Simulasi gradien mini-batch sparse/ekor-berat (heavy-tailed) di awal training\n        g = rng.standard_t(df=3, size=d) * (3.0 if t <= 5 else 1.0)\n        m = beta1 * m + (1 - beta1) * g\n        v = beta2 * v + (1 - beta2) * (g ** 2)\n        m_hat = m / (1 - beta1 ** t)\n        v_hat = v / (1 - beta2 ** t)\n        lr = base_lr * min(1.0, t / 15.0) if use_warmup else base_lr\n        delta = lr * m_hat / (np.sqrt(v_hat) + eps)\n        norms.append(float(np.linalg.norm(delta)))\n    return norms\n\nno_warm = measure_step_norms(use_warmup=False)\nwith_warm = measure_step_norms(use_warmup=True)\n\nprint(\"--- Stabilitas L2 Step Norm di 15 Langkah Pertama (Heavy-Tailed Gradients) ---\")\nprint(f\"Tanpa Warmup -> max step norm={max(no_warm[:15]):.4f} | mean(1..5)={np.mean(no_warm[:5]):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Linear Warmup-> max step norm={max(with_warm[:15]):.4f} | mean(1..5)={np.mean(with_warm[:5]):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Reduksi lonjakan awal (step 1..5): {np.mean(no_warm[:5]) / np.mean(with_warm[:5]):.2f}x lebih halus\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Audit Effective Weight Decay per Parameter (lambda nominal = 0.10) ===\n sqrt(v_hat) |   Adam+L2 lambda_eff |   AdamW lambda_eff |   Distorsi\n        0.05 |              2.00000 |            0.10000 |     20.00x\n        0.50 |              0.20000 |            0.10000 |      2.00x\n        5.00 |              0.02000 |            0.10000 |      0.20x\n       50.00 |              0.00200 |            0.10000 |      0.02x\n--- Stabilitas L2 Step Norm di 15 Langkah Pertama (Heavy-Tailed Gradients) ---\nTanpa Warmup -> max step norm=0.0800 | mean(1..5)=0.0510\nLinear Warmup-> max step norm=0.0184 | mean(1..5)=0.0090\nReduksi lonjakan awal (step 1..5): 5.70x lebih halus",
          "actualOutput": "=== Audit Effective Weight Decay per Parameter (lambda nominal = 0.10) ===\n sqrt(v_hat) |   Adam+L2 lambda_eff |   AdamW lambda_eff |   Distorsi\n        0.05 |              2.00000 |            0.10000 |     20.00x\n        0.50 |              0.20000 |            0.10000 |      2.00x\n        5.00 |              0.02000 |            0.10000 |      0.20x\n       50.00 |              0.00200 |            0.10000 |      0.02x\n--- Stabilitas L2 Step Norm di 15 Langkah Pertama (Heavy-Tailed Gradients) ---\nTanpa Warmup -> max step norm=0.0800 | mean(1..5)=0.0510\nLinear Warmup-> max step norm=0.0184 | mean(1..5)=0.0090\nReduksi lonjakan awal (step 1..5): 5.70x lebih halus",
